{"home":{"title":"Sal y Sol Sportfishing","description":"Book your private sport fishing tour in La Paz, BCS."},"nav":{"brandMain":"Sal y Sol","brandAccent":"Sportfishing","location":"La Paz, BCS","inicio":"Home","nosotros":"About","preguntas":"FAQ","contacto":"Contact","openMenu":"Open menu","closeMenu":"Close menu"},"hero":{"headlineStart":"Fishing the","headlineEmphasis":"Baja","headlineEnd":"coast just got easier","subtext":"Head out on a private boat with your own captain and gear included. Departures every day from Marina La Costa."},"booking":{"day":"Date","time":"Time","timeHelp":"Departure between 5:00 and 7:00 am","people":"Guests","submit":"Book now"},"about":{"headline":"A local fleet, captains from here","body1":"We run private sport fishing trips in the Bay of La Paz. Every booking covers the whole boat, so you never share it with strangers.","body2":"Our captains have known these waters their whole lives and go out daily. You show up at the dock, everything else is ready.","facts":{"duration":{"value":"6 to 8 hours","label":"Trip length"},"departure":{"value":"5:00 to 7:00 am","label":"You pick the departure time"},"capacity":{"value":"Up to 6 guests","label":"No minimum, no age limit"},"season":{"value":"365 days a year","label":"We sail all year round"}}},"faq":{"headline":"Frequently asked questions","items":[{"q":"What is included in the trip?","a":"Full fishing gear and a cooler with ice. Bait, fishing licence, food and drinks are not included."},{"q":"How many people fit on the boat?","a":"We have two classes: small for up to 3 guests and large for up to 6. The whole boat is yours, never shared. There is no minimum group size and no age restriction."},{"q":"What time do we leave and how long is the trip?","a":"You choose your departure time between 5:00 and 7:00 am when you book. The trip lasts 6 to 8 hours."},{"q":"Where do we meet?","a":"At Marina La Costa, Rangel y Navarro, La Paz, BCS, next to Restaurant Marina La Costa. You make your own way to the meeting point."},{"q":"How can I pay?","a":"Pay 100% online, or leave a 30% deposit online and settle the remaining 70% in cash. We accept pesos and dollars."},{"q":"What happens if the weather is bad?","a":"If the captain decides conditions are not safe, we cancel and refund 100% of what you paid."},{"q":"Can I change my booking date?","a":"Yes, with at least 48 hours notice. We move you to the next available slot."}]},"footer":{"headline":"See you at the dock","addressLabel":"Meeting point","address":"Marina La Costa, Rangel y Navarro","city":"La Paz, Baja California Sur","hoursLabel":"Departures","hours":"Every day, 5:00 to 7:00 am","rights":"All rights reserved."}}